 Call Forth says nothing about revealing until it can reveal no more.&nbsp; 

[/quote]

Call Forth has no specified deck size requirement, Dark Visionary and SST&#39;s innate powers do. Unlike Call Forth, they give an exact speficication as to how many cards are needed in order to play the power. Call Forth will <strong>try</strong> to search for X relics, but obviously you can&#39;t always have that many in even a deck of 10 cards.

This is similar to Summon Staff. You can <strong>try</strong> to summon a staff, but once you&#39;re done searching and you yeild no results, you end up drawing a card and playing a card.&nbsp;

As Matchstickman explained, whenever you&#39;re searching or revealing for an unknown amount of cards, it&#39;s possible you will or will not find what you&#39;re looking for. I&#39;m not sure why cards like Arcane Cadence are the exception, however.&nbsp;
